<title>JAPAN: Tomoku shares higher on earnings hopes.</title>
<headline>Tomoku shares higher on earnings hopes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors were attracted to Tomoku Co Ltd shares in Monday morning trade due to hopes it would announce firm half-year earnings in the upcoming corporate earnings results season, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0105 GMT, the shares of Japan's top container board maker were 19 yen higher at 623 yen.</p>
